// Title: Publisher Attachment File Dropped In Suspicious Location
// Rule ID: 3d2a2d59-929c-4b78-8c1a-145dfe9e07b1
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
